WEBVTT

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.550
M-Manager..?

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.390
Have you been drinking?

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.860
Yes, a little.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:01:59.670
How could you.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:02.140
I'm sorry.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.020
Why are you apologizing
to me?!

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.940
This is your own problem,
isn't it?!

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.570
You have very important exams
starting tomorrow, don't you?!

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.840
How could you be drinking?

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:18.060
I-I have my reasons.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:23.850
It didn't matter to me
whether you graduate or not

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:31.230
whether you become a
preschool teacher or not

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.970
I Just thought it was great
that you set a goal for yourself

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.660
to pursue wholeheartedly.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.750
M-Manager!

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.720
I don't care anymore!

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.980
If you want to graduate,

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:49.410
I suggest you take yourself
more seriously!

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.100
Kyoko!

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:18.250
Mitaka?

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:26.460
You shouldn't fall asleep
here like this.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.400
What are you doing here?

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:36.220
We haven't
gotten engaged yet,

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.130
so we're strangers.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.500
You better go home now.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:46.500
You don't want rumors
to go around.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:57.820
I wanted to speak to you
about that engagement ceremony.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.060
I'm sorry, but I can't say
I know much about it

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.000
You should ask my uncle.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.660
I'm always in
the dark, anyway.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:20.470
I was afraid you
didn't know about it...

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:22.950
...about the engagement ceremony.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:26.780
I'm sorry.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.520
It's too late now.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:34.820
I understand now.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.960
I'll ask that the engagement
ceremony be cancelled.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.070
Wh-What did you just say?

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.600
Let's call off
the engagement ceremony.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:56.590
Now that I know..

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.580
how you truly feel.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.550
Asuna?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.790
Good-bye!

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.990
I-I'm saved!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:38.390
Your owner is a good woman.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:58.780
This was meant to be.
I can't regret this.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:09.150
Oh, no! I've left
Salad behind!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:36.820
Mitaka?

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:56.930
Salad!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.410
Please get up.
You'll catch a cold.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.450
Mitaka?

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:33.350
Mitaka...!

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:05.840
We're going home, Salad.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:21.820
I just.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.990
Don't worry, Miss.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:32.060
I won't tell your parents
about last night.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:39.100
Thank you.
I'd appreciate that.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:55.560
Ouch.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.630
Breakfast?

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:18.950
Who?

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.600
Last night...

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:31.870
No way!

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:39.740
Here we are!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:43.520
Wishing you good luck
next year.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:49.970
Go! Go! Godai!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.230
What's wrong with him?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.220
Something to do with
the manager, I bet.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.790
She's not out here
to see him off.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.120
So what happened
last night?

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.920
Godai's eyes were
totally red.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.800
He seemed to have
trouble getting to sleep.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.480
Right, Grandma?

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.730
I don't know.
I was fast asleep.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:23.050
I slapped him because
he came home drunk.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.340
I slapped him hard.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.000
Don't you feel bad
about it, Manager.

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.010
Yusaku deserved it.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.920
Sure, if he
came home drunk.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:42.150
Now it's clear that
Godai won't graduate.

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.010
Don't let that
bother you, Manager.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.800
Godai doesn't deserve
any sympathy.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.630
No way will he graduate.

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:54.540
Not after getting
hit by Manager.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.600
It's a huge
psychological blow.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.710
This is your own problem,
isn't it?!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.260
If you want to graduate,

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.740
I suggest you take yourself
more seriously!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:04.180
What're you doing here?
Waiting for Godai?

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:05.710
No.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.050
I bet he's out
drinking somewhere.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:10.310
He can't be.

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:12.320
He has another exam tomorrow.

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:15.060
Then he must have run away.

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:19.650
No.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.100
Sir! You there!

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:27.070
Take advantage of
our super low price!

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.210
Times are bad.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.600
I thought you were
taking some time off

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:35.940
during your exams?

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.770
Yes, but I wanted
to stop by.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:49.960
Guess who?!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.430
Chief!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.200
Where have you been?

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:57.300
Did you miss me?
I'll be back soon, okay?

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.520
Chief! Let's play
with blocks!

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:04.700
Okay.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.700
First, I better graduate,

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.270
and then I'm going
to be a preschool teacher.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.590
He never came home
after all, did he?

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.600
I wonder if he's
taking his exams?

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:37.680
He can't. Not after
Manager slapped him.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.190
What?

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:45.010
Godai has lost his goal.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.010
He was trying to graduate

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.250
and become a preschool teacher
for you, Manager.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.360
I don't think that's
the right way

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:54.720
to choose a profession.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.680
But that's the kinda guy he is.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:59.730
No backbone.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.870
It's not about
a backbone or-

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.160
Speak of the devil

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.610
Godai?

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.800
Hi.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.070
So you're taking your exams?

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:17.430
So why are you here now?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.160
I only had one
in the morning today.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.940
Where did you
stay last night?

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.950
I stayed over at
the cabaret last night,

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:30.220
and I thought
things over.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:37.970
Akemi, I was saving that
dried squid for myself.

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:39.520
Give it up, you hog.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.320
It's squid.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.730
Are you listening?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.500
Doesn't matter,
as long as you're back.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.610
Let's toast to
Godai's return!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.400
Cheers!

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.150
I didn't come back to stay!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.010
I don't plan to come back
here for a while.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.850
Why not?

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:03.250
I want to take the exams
in my best condition.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.810
I'm going to stay at
the cabaret starting tonight.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.400
I think this place is best.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.900
There's booze here, too.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.820
And I'm here.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:21.150
So I'll come back occasionally
to get some change of clothes.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:30.280
Good luck on your exams.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.520
Thank you. I'll do my best.

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:34.990
Bye.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.790
Yusaku!

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.230
Hold it!

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:49.840
What, Grandma?

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.240
Yusaku, it's important
to be yourself.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:55.300
Don't push yourself
too hard.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.270
Nothing good happens when
you push yourself too hard.

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:02.020
Got it? Don't push
yourself any harder.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.550
Good luck, now.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.260
I'm sorry, Mitaka.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.610
Asuna has left
this letter for you.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:24.700
She left a letter?!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:27.610
S-She didn't disappear,
did she?!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.140
Disappear?

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.660
No. She went to
our vacation home in Izu.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:43.020
Neither Mitaka nor I
are emotionally ready.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.780
I believe it's too soon
to be formally engaged.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.450
Please postpone the
engagement ceremony date.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:54.430
-From Asuna

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:56.000
"Postpone"?

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:58.820
I thought last night...

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.850
I'll ask that the engagement
ceremony be cancelled.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.230
But now she just
wants a postponement...

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.200
Which means...

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.730
Did something happen?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.830
N-No!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.750
Anyway, I'd like to have
a private talk with her

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.060
as soon as possible.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.500
I tried to persuade her, but.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.310
I just can't recall
what happened after that...

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.440
How did that happen, anyway?

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.100
After that, we couldn't have..!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:56.800
It wouldn't be outside the realm
of what I could have done...

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.830
If that's the case,

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.860
I better take
the responsibility...!

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:16.730
W-What?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.970
I've been honored
to be the chauffer

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:23.620
of the Kujo household
for 20 years.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:28.890
I've been in their employ
since Miss Asuna was just born.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:34.130
She has always been a
sweet and thoughtful person.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.760
Even the events
of last night.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.700
I believe she has decided
to keep it to herself

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.780
in order to protect you.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:52.280
Please tell me where
I can find Asuna.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:01.480
You're in the midst
of exams, aren't you?

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.090
Why stay at
a place like this?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.600
I want to do this while
I'm still determined.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:11.570
I wanted to graduate and
become a preschool teacher

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.960
for a special person.

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:20.540
But if she were gone,
I fail to graduate,

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:25.710
and even give up on work, then
what would my existence mean?

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.620
What the heck
are you talking about?

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:35.400
I want to make sure that
I can make it on my own,

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:37.650
or I could never
support another person.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.950
So in other words,
did your girl leave you,

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.630
or did you leave her?
Which is it?

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.580
That's not what
I'm talking about!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:48.340
If you're the one who left her,
don't ever go back.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:52.610
Keep running until she starts
begging you to come back.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.650
In a relationship,

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.880
you lose if you have
to go after her.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:59.000
Run. Keep running
like the wind.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:02.420
And what if she
never comes after you?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.740
Stupid!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.590
That's when you run back to
her and get on your knees.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.980
Women are simple.
They dig that

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.080
I didn't run away.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:35.910
But Kyoko, I'm going
to do the best I can.

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:40.090
...so much that I may
almost forget you.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:44.330
I think I can
do that right now.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:24.200
Mitaka?!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:28.200
I'm sorry, Asuna. I couldn't
wait for you to come back.

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:46.180
Your breakfast was delicious.

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:53.600
And so...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:59.760
were you at my place
all night that night?

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:00.990
Yes.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.960
I suppose I did something
impolite to you?

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:10.540
Please don't worry about it.
I know it meant nothing.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:13.620
- Unless.
- Yes?!

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:17.720
Do you not remember anything?

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:21.870
Not everything.

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:23.680
I...

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.220
I won't forget,
because I'm a woman.

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:43.430
But don't worry. I won't
push you into marriage.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:47.470
It means enough to me

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:50.950
that you came all
the way here to see me.

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:05.400
Looks hard.

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:08.200
He is a student.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:11.230
No wonder he's exhausted.

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:19.240
I can't think about her.

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.050
..About Kyoko.

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:25.860
Kyoko.

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:29.160
Who's Kyoko?

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.420
His girl, I guess.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.600
"Determination" my ass.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:37.570
He won't last much longer.

00:23:39.550 --> 00:23:41.970
Kyoko.

00:23:50.340 --> 00:23:51.360
Asuna is...

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:52.470
Pregnant?!

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:55.060
She's carrying
Coach Mitaka's baby!

00:23:55.140 --> 00:23:56.800
How shocking!

00:23:56.880 --> 00:23:59.510
Not really.
I knew this would happen.

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.810
Next: "Asuna's, Pregnant?!
Mitaka's Surprise Shotgun-Announcement"

00:24:03.990 --> 00:24:05.780
Wh-What's going on?!
